    <!-- Statically bound via TraitModifiers: +5% Production per citizen, resolved by the custom
         EFFECT_YKKZ000_ADJUST_CITY_YIELD_PER_POPULATION_MODIFIER. Apply/Remove only aggregate the
         per-citizen percent; the engine multiplies it by the current population when it reads city
         yields (no population hook, no per-city applied total). -->
